### Windows
# Windows thumbnail cache files
Thumbs.db

# Folder config file
[Dd]esktop.ini

# Recycle Bin used on file shares
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# Windows shortcuts
*.lnk
### Obsidian (per-PC state)
windows/obsidian/*/.obsidian/workspace.json
windows/obsidian/*/.obsidian/workspace-mobile.json
windows/obsidian/*/.obsidian/plugins/colored-tags/data.json
### Obsidian: works 用の派生分（resources 用から scripts/obsidian_sync.py が生成する。追跡しない）
windows/obsidian/works/.obsidian/app.json
windows/obsidian/works/.obsidian/appearance.json
windows/obsidian/works/.obsidian/core-plugins.json
windows/obsidian/works/.obsidian/types.json
windows/obsidian/works/.obsidian/snippets/
windows/obsidian/works/.obsidian/themes/
windows/obsidian/works/.obsidian/.sync-state.json

### Claude Code（端末ごとの許可設定だけ追跡しない）
**/.claude/settings.local.json

### scratch
tmp/
